# climb_through_clouds.jsc - under -> in -> above the densest cloud nearby (teleports), then a
# real climb through the slab.
# Checks (group B): undersides when below, mist when inside, tops with dithered rims and walls
# when above.
0     persist assist 2
0     state title
+0    state free
+0.5  seek cloud under 40
+1.0  shot under
+0.1  seek cloud in 20
+0.3  shot inside
+0    assert in_cloud == 1
+0.1  seek cloud above 30
+1.0  shot above
+0    sheet climb_through_clouds 3
+0.1  seek cloud under 60
+0.2  hold W 2.5             # real climb through the slab
+0.3  shot climb_1
+0.3  shot climb_2
+0.3  shot climb_3
+0.3  shot climb_4
+0.3  shot climb_5
+0.3  shot climb_6
+0    sheet climb_sequence 3
+0    end
